    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38496" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prōcrĕātor</span></b> ,
			ōris, m.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				begetter</i>, <i>producer</i>, <i>creator</i> (class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ille procreator mundi deus,</span>”
				<i>author</i>, <i>creator</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Univ. 8, 23</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">a procreatoribus amari,</span>”
				<i>by one's parents</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Fin. 4, 7, 17</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">5, 23, 65</span></i>.</div>
